1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:02,856
(Sheldon:)It's just a privilege
to watch your mind at work.

2
00:00:03,981 --> 00:00:06,441
(Sheldon:)Come on,
we have a combined IQ of 360.

3
00:00:06,609 --> 00:00:09,699
(Leonard:)We should be able to figure out
how to get into a stupid building.

4
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:13,571
[BUZZES]

5
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:17,163
- What do you think their combined IQ is?
- Just grab the door.

6
00:00:19,163 --> 00:00:21,043
LEONARD:
This is it.

7
00:00:21,707 --> 00:00:22,877
(Leonard(pushes buzzer):)I'll do the talking.

8
00:00:23,042 --> 00:00:25,752
(Sheldon:)Good thinking, I'll just be the muscle.

9
00:00:32,885 --> 00:00:36,095
- Yeah?
- I'm Leonard, this is Sheldon.

10
00:00:36,264 --> 00:00:38,054
(Sheldon:)From the intercom.

11
00:00:39,392 --> 00:00:41,852
(Man:)How the hell did you get in the building?

12
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,400
(Leonard:)We're scientists.

13
00:00:46,232 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)Tell him about our IQ.

